OL,3,AWorld-first surgery for baby's rare
OL,4,Askull condition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "happy and cheeky" baby boy with a
OL,7,Frare skull condition is doing well a
OL,8,Fyear after becoming the first in the
OL,9,Fworld to be given a new type of
OL,10,Ftreatment.
OL,12,FOne-year-old Rory Potter, from
OL,13,FChesterfield in Derbyshire, was
OL,14,Fdiagnosed with severe sagittal
OL,15,Fcraniosynostosis - a condition where
OL,16,Fthe skull fuses before birth - shortly
OL,17,Fafter he was born in April last year.
OL,19,FHe underwent surgery in September to
OL,20,Fhave "super elastic" springs inserted,
OL,21,Fwhich gradually reshaped his skull
OL,22,Fbefore being removed.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
